        "Content": "<ul><li> Substantial investment opportunity </li><li> Prime Dublin 4 location </li><li> Rare opportunity to acquire a property in Sandymount with exceptional potential (STPP) </li><li> Excellent public transport including bus and DART </li><li> Off street parking </li><li> Extensive rear garden with lovely southwest orientation </li><li> Gas Fired Central Heating. </li><li> Short walk to Sandymount Village </li><li> D1 BER Rating</li></ul>"
